{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Do not inspect input when collection is disabled**\n\nEven with `content.input(false)`, this converts the input through Jackson before the handler. Custom-SerDes objects can invoke side-effecting getters, and large excluded inputs still incur allocation and latency. Check `includeInput` before snapshotting and add a disabled-input test using a side-effecting non-Jackson payload.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNyeL","finding_digest":"f74add3470e39517380d2850cc17c0f303247036b98764326c11164511677391","finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.oninvocationstart::excluded-input-no-touch","line":120,"observation_digest":"2f012b13277236c6051cdc8c782d64fb9bf49522978cf0a6fd4245b42cd218bc","observation_id":"aro_v1_f4aswezhoi3mmbi43sghqlle7o","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_65fn2ndq4okrooanfbimyf6a6m","published_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:38Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iee7bcnfj7lcytdfodx5mvljjs","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"ce1de5fa37a2da2f6805802585eeee8390944531","reviewer":"codex","start_line":120,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_tr6lbve6jto2fv6xizgsdziyzf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:38Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
